---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Samband
description: Fá samband við GameJam Føroya — teldupostur, telefon og adressa.
---

<section class="page-hero">
  {#- Decorative backdrop: the heading and intro carry the meaning, so the
      photo takes an empty alt rather than reading a scene description out
      before the page title. -#}
  <figure class="page-hero__media" aria-hidden="true">
    {% image "src/assets/images/Event Photos/people talking in the hallway one is wearing a GJF tshirt.jpg", "", "100vw", "page-hero__img page-hero__img--faces" %}
  </figure>
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="page-hero__title">Fá samband</h1>
    <p class="page-hero__lead">
      Hevur tú spurningar, vilt tú vera við, ella hugsar tú um at stuðla?
      Vit vilja fegin hoyra frá tær.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="reach-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="panel">
      <h2 class="section__title" id="reach-title">Skriva ella ring</h2>
      {#- The whole tile is the link, so it stays an easy tap on a phone.
          The postal address lives in the "Felagsskapurin" panel below. -#}
      <ul class="contact__methods" role="list">
        <li>
          <a class="contact__method" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">
            <span class="contact__label">Teldupostur</span>
            <span class="contact__value">{{ site.email }}</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a class="contact__method" href="tel:{{ site.phone | replace(' ', '') }}">
            <span class="contact__label">Telefon</span>
            <span class="contact__value">{{ site.phone }}</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="sponsor-title">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section__title" id="sponsor-title">Kundi tú hugsað tær at stuðla?</h2>
    <p class="section__lead">
      Okkara tiltøk eru 100% ókeypis fyri luttakararnar. Stuðulin verður
      nýttur til mat, drekka, vinningar, tilfar og náttarvakt.
      Skriva til okkum á <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>,
      so senda vit tær eina lýsing av møguleikum.
    </p>
    <p class="section__lead">
      <a href="/#sponsors">Sí, hvørji stuðla okkum í dag.</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="org-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="panel">
      <h2 class="section__title" id="org-title">Felagsskapurin</h2>
      {#- Label-over-value, the same pairing the "Skriva ella ring" tiles above
          use — but without their border and hover, since none of these are
          links and they should not invite a tap. -#}
      <dl class="contact__org">
        <div class="contact__org-item">
          <dt class="contact__label">Navn</dt>
          <dd class="contact__org-value">{{ site.legalName }}</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="contact__org-item">
          <dt class="contact__label">Slag</dt>
          <dd class="contact__org-value">{{ site.orgType }}</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="contact__org-item">
          <dt class="contact__label">V-tal</dt>
          <dd class="contact__org-value">{{ site.vtal }}</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="contact__org-item">
          <dt class="contact__label">Adressa</dt>
          <dd class="contact__org-value">{{ site.address }}</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
      {#- The English "official website of…" sentence. Deliberately quiet, and
          ruled off — it is not for our Faroese visitors but for anyone
          verifying that gj.fo belongs to the registered association (Google
          for Nonprofits). It used to sit in the site-wide footer. -#}
      <p class="contact__identity">{{ site.identityEn }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
